// rtp
Alias[GG_RTP]: %DOT-60%%MAP-21%%BORDER-0A%%SOUNDID-4719%%RED%•%ORANGE%•%YELLOW%•               %RED%%NAME%%YELLOW%               %YELLOW%•%ORANGE%•%RED%•
// rid
